<Club title="THE 3D FUTURE · Terms" description="The terms of THE 3D FUTURE, the club of Omnya Lab: what is inside, price, renewal, cancelling and the 14-day withdrawal.">
  <h1>The <span>3D</span> Future · terms</h1>
  <p class="mute">Last updated: 20 November 2026</p>
  <p class="lead">THE 3D FUTURE is the paid club of Omnya Lab, where we show you how we build the 3D of our reels. These are its terms, short on purpose. If something is not clear, write to <a href="mailto:info@omnyalab.com">info@omnyalab.com</a> before you join.</p>

  <h2>Who sells</h2>
  <p>Omnya Lab, Venice, Italy, VAT IT05578770264, <a href="mailto:info@omnyalab.com">info@omnyalab.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>What's inside</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Video courses that walk you through our builds step by step, starting with your own tower where buyers choose their floor.</li>
    <li>The files, prompts and Claude skills of the builds from our reels.</li>
    <li>A place to post what you build (Show your build), where Nico looks at every first build himself.</li>
    <li>The House Builder skill, a skill for Claude that is yours to keep, even if you leave.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Price</h2>
  <p>Prices are in euro and you see the one that applies to you before you pay:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Founders' round (from the reservations to 4 December 2026): €9 a month, or €90 a year, for everyone who reserves or joins, for as long as the membership stays active. From 5 December 2026: €19 a month or €190 a year.</li>
    <li>Reservation before the doors open: you give your card when you reserve and nothing is charged that day. The membership and the first period start on Saturday 28 November 2026 at 9:00 (Rome), when your card is charged automatically. If you cancel before then, nothing is charged.</li>
    <li>The first 100 who reserve their seat before the doors open also get our three playbooks and the full 3D AI Mastery course, theirs to keep, sent with the welcome email once the first payment has gone through. Who joins without a reservation does not get them.</li>
    <li>If you bought one of our guides, €9 a month (€90 a year) after 4 December 2026 too.</li>

  </ul>
  <p>Payment goes through Stripe.</p>

  <h2>Renewal</h2>
  <p>The club renews by itself at the end of each period, every month or every year depending on the plan you picked, and the card you paid with is charged then, until you cancel.</p>

  <h2>How to cancel</h2>
  <p>Whenever you want: one tap from the link in your welcome email (subject: you're in) or in your reservation email (subject: your seat is reserved), or reply to that email and we cancel it for you. You keep the club until the end of the period you already paid for, and nothing more is charged after that.</p>

  <h2>Withdrawal within 14 days</h2>
  <p>If you join as a consumer, you can withdraw from the contract within 14 days of joining, without giving a reason. Use the withdrawal function on <a href="/withdraw">omnyalab.com/withdraw</a> (Withdraw from contract here): write your name, your email and which purchase, then confirm. You get a receipt by email right away, with the date and time, and we write to you by email about the refund.</p>

  <h2>Access through Skool</h2>
  <p>The club lives in our private room on Skool (skool.com). Ask to join with the email you paid with and we let you in by hand. Skool is a separate service with its own terms. When you cancel or withdraw, your access to the room ends.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:info@omnyalab.com">info@omnyalab.com</a>. These terms follow Italian law, and consumers keep the protections of the country they live in. For the rest, our general <a href="/terms">terms of sale</a> and <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> apply.</p>
</Club>
